  m_text: "Reed\u2019s Chase is a story about bullying, cyberbullying, isolation,
    and suicide. These themes are implied, but the game can still be upsetting.\r\nIf
    these topics are hard for you right now, it\u2019s okay to skip this game or
    come back later. Your wellbeing matters more than finishing the story.\r\nIf
    you or someone you know is struggling, you\u2019re not alone. In Spain, you can
    call 024. In the United States, call or text 988. Elsewhere, findahelpline.com
    lists free, confidential lines by country. If you\u2019re in immediate danger,
    contact your local emergency number.\r\n\r\nSincerely and with all our love,
    we hope you enjoy the experience.\r\n"
